  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8202.08 Law enforcement agency",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8202.08 “Law enforcement agency” means the New Hampshire state police, police departments of cities, towns, and villages districts, county sheriff’s departments, the New Hampshire state fish & game department, the New Hampshire department of corrections, and county and municipal jail facilities.\n\nSource. #13298, eff 11-30-21",
